ull/110791.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110791.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Storing fractional margins when editor scale changes can cause issues when `StyleBox::get_margin()` is stored in an integer variable which makes it lose precision and then calling `StyleBox::get_minimum_size()` which adds up the precision again.\r\nAlso makes Control nodes returns size +1 if both margins can be rounded up\r\n\r\n* Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108520\r\n* Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110577\r\n* Revert: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105870\r\n* Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105827\r\n\r\n* Also related to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103224","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110791/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110791/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}